Z||000004||Formula88||06-30-2001||10:55 PM||||Well, the missing guy is the 3rd from the right in the top pic.  Since he's only in the top portion of the picture, when you swap the papers, he can go anywhere.  As for "where does he go" I'm not sure what you mean.  His spot is vacant in the bottom pic, but he's now 7th from the left.  If you notice, counting from left to right, in the top pic, number 7 and 13 are only in the top pic.  In the bottom pic, number 7 is now number 1, and has legs in the bottom pic.  Hence, one less person in the picture.<p>[This message has been edited by Formula88 (edited 06-30-2001).]||||reg||1
